      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Scrolling Capture Control" } } }
    },
    "诊断信息已复制" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Diagnostics copied" } } }
    },
    "诊断报告已导出" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Diagnostics exported" } } }
    },
    "辅助功能权限已就绪" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Accessibility permission is ready" } } }
    },
    "需注意" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Needs Attention" } } }
    },
    "PDF 内容" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "PDF Content" } } }
    },
    "从所选应用复制的内容不会保存到 PEEK 剪贴板历史。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Content copied from the selected app will not be saved to PEEK clipboard history." } } }
    },
    "从这些应用复制的内容不会进入历史。PEEK 不会默认排除任何应用。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Content copied from these apps will not enter history. PEEK excludes no apps by default." } } }
    },
    "正在加载网页预览…" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Loading webpage preview…" } } }
    },
    "网页预览加载失败" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Unable to load webpage preview" } } }
    },
    "在浏览器中打开" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open in Browser" } } }
    },
    "复制链接" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Copy Link" } } }
    },
    "离线链接预览，不会在 PEEK 内连接网站。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Offline link preview. PEEK does not connect to the website." } } }
    },
    "内容已复制；允许辅助功能权限后才能自动粘贴到其他应用。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Content was copied. Accessibility permission is required to paste into another app automatically." } } }
    },
    "删除" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Delete" } } }
    },
    "删除后无法恢复，不会影响当前系统剪贴板中的内容。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Deleted history cannot be recovered. The current system clipboard is not affected." } } }
    },
    "剪贴板" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Clipboard" } } }
    },
    "剪贴板历史" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Clipboard History" } } }
    },
    "剪贴板历史暂不可用：%@" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Clipboard history is unavailable: %@" } } }
    },
    "剪贴板历史（快捷键冲突，可在设置中修改）" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Clipboard History (shortcut conflict; change it in Settings)" } } }
    },
    "剪贴板历史在本机保留最近 100 条文字、图片、链接和文件记录，随时可以重新复制或粘贴。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Clipboard History keeps the 100 most recent text, image, link, and file items on this Mac so you can copy or paste them again." } } }
    },
    "剪贴板可能包含密码或私密信息；处理敏感内容前可以暂停记录，或把对应应用加入忽略列表。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The clipboard may contain passwords or private information. Pause recording or ignore the relevant app before handling sensitive content." } } }
    },
    "历史内容只保存在 PEEK 的沙盒目录，不会上传网络，也不会存入 Keychain。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "History is stored only in PEEK's sandbox. It is not uploaded or stored in Keychain." } } }
    },
    "历史内容位于 PEEK 的沙盒目录，不会自动上传网络。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "History stays in PEEK's sandbox and is never uploaded automatically." } } }
    },
    "原应用已经关闭，内容已保留在剪贴板中" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The original app has closed. The content remains on the clipboard." } } }
    },
    "双击或按 Enter 可复制历史内容，Command + Enter 可复制并粘贴到之前的应用。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Double-click or press Enter to copy history. Press Command + Enter to copy and paste into the previous app." } } }
    },
    "启用剪贴板历史" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Enable Clipboard History" } } }
    },
    "图片 %@" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Image %@" } } }
    },
    "在本机保留最近 100 条复制内容" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Keep the 100 most recent copied items on this Mac" } } }
    },
    "复制内容后会显示在这里" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Copied content will appear here" } } }
    },
    "复制并粘贴" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Copy and Paste" } } }
    },
    "存储目录不可用" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Storage directory unavailable" } } }
    },
    "富文本" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Rich Text" } } }
    },
    "已保存记录" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Saved Items" } } }
    },
    "已删除一条记录" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Item deleted" } } }
    },
    "已复制回剪贴板" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Copied back to clipboard" } } }
    },
    "已粘贴" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Pasted" } } }
    },
    "当前剪贴板内容类型暂不支持" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This clipboard content type is not supported yet" } } }
    },
    "忽略应用" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Ignored Apps" } } }
    },
    "找回最近复制的内容" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Recover Recently Copied Content" } } }
    },
    "指引：在“剪贴板”中开启记录并设置快捷键；打开历史后用方向键选择，Enter 复制，Command + Enter 复制并粘贴到之前的应用。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Guide: Enable history and set its shortcut in Clipboard. In the history window, use the arrow keys to select, Enter to copy, or Command + Enter to copy and paste into the previous app." } } }
    },
    "敏感应用可忽略" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Ignore Sensitive Apps" } } }
    },
    "可以暂停记录，或将密码管理器等应用加入忽略列表。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Pause recording or add apps such as password managers to the ignore list." } } }
    },
    "只保存在本机" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Stored Only on This Mac" } } }
    },
    "PEEK 将文件查找、剪贴板、截图、识别和翻译集中在菜单栏中。接下来会逐项介绍，但不会替你执行操作或申请权限。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "PEEK brings file search, clipboard history, capture, recognition, and translation together in the menu bar. The guide introduces each feature without taking actions or requesting permissions for you." } } }
    },
    "打开剪贴板历史" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open Clipboard History" } } }
    },
    "搜索剪贴板历史" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Search Clipboard History" } } }
    },
    "支持文字、富文本、图片、链接、文件和文件夹；关闭后已有记录仍会保留。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Supports text, rich text, images, links, files, and folders. Existing history remains when disabled." } } }
    },
    "数据库尚未打开" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Database is not open" } } }
    },
    "无法将历史内容写回系统剪贴板" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Unable to write history back to the system clipboard" } } }
    },
    "无法打开 SQLite 数据库" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Unable to open the SQLite database" } } }
    },
    "无法读取图片预览" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Unable to read image preview" } } }
    },
    "无法读取该应用的 Bundle ID" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Unable to read this app's Bundle ID" } } }
    },
    "最多保留 100 条，内容仅存储在本机" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Keeps up to 100 items, stored only on this Mac" } } }
    },
    "未知数据库错误" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Unknown database error" } } }
    },
    "本地存储" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Local Storage" } } }
    },
    "没有匹配的记录" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "No matching items" } } }
    },
    "添加应用…" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Add App…" } } }
    },
    "清空全部剪贴板历史？" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Clear all clipboard history?" } } }
    },
    "清空全部记录" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Clear All Items" } } }
    },
    "移除" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Remove" } } }
    },
    "记录" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Recording" } } }
    },
    "达到 100 条或 256 MB 后，会自动从最早的记录开始清理。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "After 100 items or 256 MB, the oldest history is removed automatically." } } }
    },
    "这会永久删除 PEEK 本地保存的剪贴板内容，无法撤销。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This permanently deletes clipboard content stored locally by PEEK and cannot be undone." } } }
    },
    "这条内容大小为 %@，超过单条 32 MB 的安全限制，未保存。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This item is %@, exceeding the 32 MB per-item safety limit, and was not saved." } } }
    },
    "这条历史内容已损坏或被系统清理" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This history item is damaged or was removed by the system" } } }
    },
    "选择一条记录查看内容" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Select an item to preview it" } } }
    },
    "选择要忽略的应用" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Choose an App to Ignore" } } }
    },
    "链接" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Links" } } }
    },
    "隐私" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Privacy" } } }
    },
    "OCR 在本机识别中英文；二维码识别成功后，会按文本、网址或图片类型展示结果。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "OCR recognizes Chinese and English on this Mac. QR code results are shown as text, a web address, or an image as appropriate." } } }
    },
    "PEEK 会优先识别鼠标所在的可滚动区域；识别不到时仍可自由调整选框。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "PEEK first looks for a scrollable area under the pointer. If none is found, you can still adjust the selection freely." } } }
    },
    "PEEK 将文件查找、截图、识别和翻译集中在菜单栏中。接下来会逐项介绍，但不会替你执行操作或申请权限。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "PEEK brings file search, screenshots, recognition, and translation together in the menu bar. This guide explains each feature without taking action or requesting permission for you." } } }
    },
    "PEEK 已准备就绪" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "PEEK Is Ready" } } }
    },
    "PEEK 新手教程" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "PEEK Quick Start Guide" } } }
    },
    "上一步" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Previous" } } }
    },
    "下一步" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Next" } } }
    },
    "不授权某项权限只会限制相关功能，不影响其他已就绪功能。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Declining a permission only limits the related feature. Other available features keep working." } } }
    },
    "中英或其他混合文本会优先判断占主导的语言，也可手动指定。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "For mixed-language text, PEEK prioritizes the dominant language. You can also choose the language manually." } } }
    },
    "主动翻译" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Translate on Demand" } } }
    },
    "主语言识别" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Primary Language Detection" } } }
    },
    "了解权限与隐私边界" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Understand Permissions and Privacy" } } }
    },
    "二维码结果" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "QR Code Results" } } }
    },
    "从查找开始" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Start with Search" } } }
    },
    "使用渐进式翻译" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Translate at Your Pace" } } }
    },
    "保存前检查" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Check Before Saving" } } }
    },
    "修改不合适时，可恢复 PEEK 提供的默认组合。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "If a change does not work for you, restore PEEK's default shortcuts." } } }
    },
    "先选区，再确认" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Select, Then Confirm" } } }
    },
    "关闭设置不会退出 PEEK；从菜单栏随时打开功能。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Closing Settings does not quit PEEK. Its features remain available from the menu bar." } } }
    },
    "关闭设置后，PEEK 会继续驻留在菜单栏。你可以随时回到设置重新查看本教程或调整功能。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "After you close Settings, PEEK stays in the menu bar. Return to Settings anytime to review this guide or adjust features." } } }
    },
    "区域截图与标注" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Region Capture and Annotation" } } }
    },
    "可以恢复默认" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Restore Defaults Anytime" } } }
    },
    "可使用画笔、形状、文字、马赛克、取色、OCR 和二维码工具。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Use drawing, shapes, text, pixelation, color picking, OCR, and QR code tools." } } }
    },
    "可调整透明度、结果密度、预览区域和跨显示器位置。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Adjust opacity, result density, preview size, and placement across displays." } } }
    },
    "增量索引" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Incremental Indexing" } } }
    },
    "始终可以手动调整" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Always Adjustable" } } }
    },
    "完成教程" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Finish Guide" } } }
    },
    "应用优先" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Apps First" } } }
    },
    "当前指引位置" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Guide Location" } } }
    },
    "录入后会立即显示启用、停用或冲突状态。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "After recording a shortcut, PEEK immediately shows whether it is active, disabled, or conflicting." } } }
    },
    "快速找到应用、文件与文件夹" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Quickly Find Apps, Files, and Folders" } } }
    },
    "截取完整的滚动内容" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Capture Complete Scrolling Content" } } }
    },
    "拖出选区后，可移动或调整范围，再使用紧贴选区的工具栏完成标注、复制或保存。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "After drawing a selection, move or resize it, then use the nearby toolbar to annotate, copy, or save." } } }
    },
    "指引：在“关于”中打开内置隐私政策；需要目录、屏幕录制或辅助功能权限时，PEEK 会提供明确按钮，由你决定是否授权。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Try it: Open the built-in Privacy Policy in About. When folder, screen recording, or accessibility access is needed, PEEK provides a clear button and lets you decide whether to grant it." } } }
    },
    "指引：在“外观”选择跟随系统、浅色或深色；在“通用”设置搜索窗口出现的屏幕和位置。日常入口都在菜单栏图标中。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Try it: In Appearance, choose System, Light, or Dark. In General, choose the display and position for the search window. Everyday features are available from the menu bar icon." } } }
    },
    "指引：在“快捷键”页点击右侧按键框，再按下新组合；出现冲突提示时，请换用包含 Command、Option 或 Control 的组合。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Try it: In Shortcuts, click the shortcut field on the right and press a new combination. If PEEK reports a conflict, try one that includes Command, Option, or Control." } } }
    },
    "指引：在“搜索”中先查看“应用搜索”，再进入“文档搜索”添加需要查找的文件夹；索引进度与日志可在同一页查看。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Try it: In Search, review App Search, then open Document Search to add folders. Indexing progress and logs appear on the same page." } } }
    },
    "指引：将鼠标放在网页或列表的滚动区域内，再按滚动截图快捷键；确认选区后开始采集，手动模式需点击“停止并拼接”。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Try it: Place the pointer over a scrollable webpage or list, then press the scrolling capture shortcut. Confirm the selection to begin. In manual mode, click Stop and Stitch when finished." } } }
    },
    "指引：打开翻译浮窗，输入或粘贴文字，选择目标语言，然后按 Command + Enter 开始翻译。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Try it: Open the translation window, type or paste text, choose a target language, then press Command + Enter to translate." } } }
    },
    "指引：按截图 OCR 快捷键后拖选文字区域；普通截图选区检测到二维码时，可主动点击工具栏中的二维码按钮。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Try it: Press the screenshot OCR shortcut and select a text area. When a regular screenshot selection contains a QR code, click the QR code button in the toolbar." } } }
    },
    "指引：授权屏幕录制后按区域截图快捷键，拖选范围；未选择工具时直接拖动选区，双击或按 Enter 复制结果。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Try it: After granting screen recording access, press the region capture shortcut and drag to select an area. With no tool selected, drag the selection to move it. Double-click or press Enter to copy the result." } } }
    },
    "指引：教程会自动切换顶部设置分类。请按“下一步”依次查看，不需要现在完成任何授权。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Try it: The guide switches Settings categories automatically. Select Next to continue. You do not need to grant any permission now." } } }
    },
    "指引：点击“完成教程”保存首次使用状态。以后可在设置中选择“重新查看新手教程”再次打开。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Try it: Select Finish Guide to save your first-run status. You can open it again anytime by choosing Review Tutorial in Settings." } } }
    },
    "按 Command + Enter 才开始翻译，输入文字本身不会触发请求。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Translation begins only when you press Command + Enter. Typing alone does not send a request." } } }
    },
    "按文件查找快捷键，输入应用、文件或文件夹名称。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Press the file search shortcut, then enter an app, file, or folder name." } } }
    },
    "按需授权" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Permission Only When Needed" } } }
    },
    "搜索使用本机索引，应用优先展示；文件和文件夹会在各自分组中出现。索引完成的内容可以立即查询。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Search uses an on-device index and lists apps first. Files and folders appear in separate groups, and indexed items become searchable immediately." } } }
    },
    "搜索索引不包含文件正文；截图和 OCR 结果不会由 PEEK 自动上传。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The search index does not include file contents. PEEK does not automatically upload screenshots or OCR results." } } }
    },
    "操作由你决定" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "You Stay in Control" } } }
    },
    "教程只做说明，不会自动截图、索引、翻译或申请权限。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This guide only explains features. It never starts a capture, index, translation, or permission request." } } }
    },
    "文件索引、截图、OCR 和 Apple 本地翻译优先在本机处理；只有你启用的云翻译服务会接收主动提交的文本。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "File indexing, screenshots, OCR, and Apple on-device translation are processed locally whenever possible. Only cloud translation services you enable receive text you explicitly submit." } } }
    },
    "本地 OCR" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "On-Device OCR" } } }
    },
    "本地优先" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Local First" } } }
    },
    "欢迎使用 PEEK" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Welcome to PEEK" } } }
    },
    "每项核心功能都可以单独录入快捷键。PEEK 会检查应用内部重复和可识别的系统冲突。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Each core feature has its own shortcut. PEEK checks for duplicates within the app and recognizable system conflicts." } } }
    },
    "用几分钟了解每一项核心功能" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Take a few minutes to learn each core feature" } } }
    },
    "界面可跟随系统深浅色，也能调整搜索窗口的透明度、结果密度和预览方式。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The interface can follow the system appearance. You can also adjust search window opacity, result density, and preview layout." } } }
    },
    "相同名称下应用排在文件和文件夹之前，常用应用会逐步靠前。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "For matching names, apps appear before files and folders. Frequently used apps gradually move higher." } } }
    },
    "窗口主体、控件和文字会一起适配当前系统配色。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The window, controls, and text all adapt to the current system appearance." } } }
    },
    "第 %d 步，共 %d 步" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Step %d of %d" } } }
    },
    "网址可以复制或打开，文本可以复制，图片内容可以预览。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Copy or open web addresses, copy text, and preview image content." } } }
    },
    "翻译使用独立浮窗。先输入原文，再主动提交翻译，避免输入过程中反复请求。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Translation uses a separate window. Enter the source text, then submit it when ready to avoid repeated requests while typing." } } }
    },
    "自动识别只是起点，最终以你确认的选框为准。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Automatic detection is only a starting point. The selection you confirm is always final." } } }
    },
    "自动识别目标" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Automatic Target Detection" } } }
    },
    "菜单栏中的设置入口会保留教程、权限和所有个性化选项。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Settings in the menu bar keeps this guide, permissions, and all personalization options within reach." } } }
    },
    "菜单栏常驻" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Always in the Menu Bar" } } }
    },
    "设置顺手且不冲突的快捷键" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Choose Convenient, Conflict-Free Shortcuts" } } }
    },
    "识别文字与二维码" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Recognize Text and QR Codes" } } }
    },
    "识别结果保留换行并尽量还原版式，可直接复制。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Recognition preserves line breaks and restores the original layout when possible. Results can be copied directly." } } }
    },
    "调整外观与菜单栏使用方式" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Customize Appearance and Menu Bar Access" } } }
    },
    "跟着做" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Try It" } } }
    },
    "跳过教程" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Skip Guide" } } }
    },
    "选区内直接编辑" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Edit in the Selection" } } }
    },
    "选区只是范围标记，移动和缩放后才按最终区域生成图片。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The selection only marks an area. PEEK creates the image from its final position and size." } } }
    },
    "随时回来调整" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Adjust Anytime" } } }
    },
    "首次快速建立索引，之后在后台低占用更新；未索引内容暂时不会出现。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The first index is built quickly. Later updates run in the background with low resource use, and items not yet indexed remain temporarily unavailable." } } }
    },
    "默认 %@" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Default: %@" } } }
    },
    "鼠标位于滚动区时预选内容区域，其他位置预选当前窗口。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "PEEK preselects the content area when the pointer is over a scrolling region, and the current window elsewhere." } } }
    },
    "重新查看新手教程" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Review Tutorial" } } }
    },
    "再次查看 PEEK 的核心功能与操作指引" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Review PEEK's core features and usage guide." } } }
    },
    "%@ 配置已保存" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%@ configuration saved" } } }
    },
    "API Key" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "API Key" } } }
    },
    "保存在 macOS 钥匙串；调用时会发送给 Google 验证" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Stored in macOS Keychain and sent to Google for request authentication" } } }
    },
    "APP ID" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "APP ID" } } }
    },
    "Apple 本地翻译" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Apple On-Device Translation" } } }
    },
    "Apple 本地翻译由 macOS 在本机处理；如果同时启用云翻译，同一次提交的正文仍会发送给所有已启用且配置完整的云服务商。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Apple on-device translation is processed by macOS on this Mac. If cloud translation is also enabled, the same submitted text is sent to every enabled and fully configured cloud provider." } } }
    },
    "Google 翻译" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Google Translate" } } }
    },
    "Google 翻译（可选）" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Google Translate (Optional)" } } }
    },
    "云端" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cloud" } } }
    },
    "云端翻译失败" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cloud translation failed" } } }
    },
    "云端翻译完成" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cloud translation complete" } } }
    },
    "仅在你点击“翻译”或按 Command + Enter 后，云服务商才会收到正文、语言信息和所需认证数据。请求不经过 PEEK 自有服务器；PEEK 不建立云端翻译历史，也不在应用日志中记录正文或凭据。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Only after you click Translate or press Command + Enter do cloud providers receive the text, language information, and required authentication data. Requests do not pass through a PEEK-operated server. PEEK does not create a cloud translation history or write text or credentials to its application logs." } } }
    },
    "云翻译凭据保存在 macOS 钥匙串；服务商可能依据其条款处理数据，使用前请查看对应隐私政策。" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cloud translation credentials are stored in macOS Keychain. Providers may process data under their own terms, so review the applicable privacy policy before use." } } }
    },
    "了解 PEEK 如何处理数据、权限和第三方服务" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Learn how PEEK handles data, permissions, and third-party services" } } }
    },
    "报告问题或获取使用帮助" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Report a problem or get help" } } }
    },
    "支持与反馈" : {
      "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Support & Feedback" } } }
    },
    "隐私与支持" : {
